# ✍️ Naming Conventions

Follow these rules to keep the codebase consistent and IDE-search-friendly.

---

## 1 — Components

| Aspect                     | Rule                                                      |
| -------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| File name & default export | **PascalCase.tsx** (`UserCard.tsx`)                       |
| Component identifier       | Same **PascalCase** as file (`function UserCard() …`)     |
| Props shape                | Define **type**, never `interface`                        |
| Props naming               | Must match component + `Props` suffix (`UserCardProps`)   |
| Re-export                  | Use default export if file contains _only_ one component. |

Screens/scenes that represent a distinct exhibit step use a **`*Screen.tsx`** suffix.

```
WelcomeScreen.tsx
ScanBadgeScreen.tsx
AttractScreen.tsx
IdleOverlay.tsx
```

---

## 2 — Hooks

- File & function must start with **`use`** followed by PascalCase. _Example_: `useUserAttendance.ts → export function useUserAttendance() { … }`

---

## 3 — Helpers

| Category                                | Naming                                      | Export style                                   |
| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| Stand-alone helper file                 | **PascalCase.ts** (`FormatPhone.ts`)        | `export default function FormatPhone(…) { … }` |
| Minor helpers inside `src/lib/utils.ts` | **camelCase** (`formatDate`, `toTitleCase`) | **named** exports only                         |

---

## 4 — Routes (`src/routes`)

- File names follow TanStack file-system router norms.
    - Static segments → **kebab-case** (`dashboard.tsx`)
    - Dynamic segments → `$param.tsx` (`$userId.tsx`)
    - Layout wrapper → `_layout.tsx`
- Route component identifiers are **PascalCase**.

---

## 5 — Services (`src/services/<Feature>`)

| File           | Entity                         | Naming                                                        | Export    |
| -------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- | --------- |
| `*.api.ts`     | Each outbound call             | **camelCase** (`getUser`, `createEvent`)                      | **named** |
| `*.schemas.ts` | Zod schema objects             | **PascalCase** (`CompetitionPhasesSchema`, `EventMainSchema`) | **named** |
|                | TS types inferred from schemas | Same name + `Type` (`EventMainSchemaType`)                    | **named** |

---

## 6 — Miscellaneous

- Constants (`src/constants/`) → **SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE**.
- Enums → `PascalCase` enum name, `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` members.

